Firmographic Data is most beneficial to investors who seek information to make their investment decisions easier. It allows seeing the full picture of the company's specifics, such as size, location, industry, revenue, and more.

Lead generation companies can also benefit from Company Data. You can filter businesses by your ICP criteria and find all prospects fitting the criteria.

Example use cases

✅ See the whole picture. Group and target companies by size, industry, category, founding date, and other data points.

✅ Map company locations. Target only those businesses that are located in relevant areas.

✅ Dig deep into company structures. Understand specific relationships between different companies to make informed business decisions.


